Janis Papanagnou wrote:
>
> Does anybody know whether the Chromatic Dragon is edible?

Any dragon should be edible.

> Some spoiler
> says that he might even confer petrification resistance; is that true?
> I always thought that resistance to stoning is restricted to monsters.

The Chromatic Dragon has every attribute of every color
in theory, so eating it should give a 1/9th chance of
gaining any of the 9 intrinsics by that theory.  Since
6 of the 9 are gainable (fire, cold, shock, disint,
sleep, poison) and 3 aren't (MR, reflection, acid), I
think the way it works in practice is since there are
6 possible resistances to be gained it does a 1-in-6
roll.

Stoning resistance isn't given by any dragon, therefore
it isn't given by the Chomatic Dragon.

Checking the spoilers it shows the 6 possible resistances
without mention of whether each gets a 1-in-6 or 1-in-9
chance.  The fact that the intrinsics are listed confirms
it can be eaten.



